            "value": "ป้อนอีโมจิที่สมบูรณ์หนึ่งตัว ใช้ Control–Command–Space เพื่อเปิดตัวแสดงอักขระ"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tam bir emoji girin. Karakter Görüntüleyici'yi açmak için Control–Command–Boşluk'u kullanın."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
