            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能验证购买资格. 尝试恢复购买。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能驗證購買資格. 嘗試恢復購買。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not verify your App Store purchase history. Try Restore Purchases.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
