    "Your Unlimited access is active. Lifetime owners can upgrade to Family Sharing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Unlimited access is active. Lifetime owners can upgrade to Family Sharing."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "وصولك غير المحدود نشط. يمكن للمالكين مدى الحياة الترقية إلى Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "আপনার সীমাহীন অ্যাক্সেস সক্রিয় আছে. আজীবন মালিকরা Family Sharing -এ আপগ্রেড করতে পারেন।"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr unbegrenzter Zugang ist aktiv. Lebenslange Besitzer können auf Family Sharing upgraden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu acceso ilimitado está activo. Los propietarios de por vida pueden actualizar a Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre accès illimité est actif. Les propriétaires à vie peuvent passer au Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपकी असीमित पहुंच सक्रिय है. आजीवन मालिक Family Sharing में अपग्रेड कर सकते हैं।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Akses Tak Terbatas Anda aktif. Pemilik seumur hidup dapat meningkatkan ke Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo accesso illimitato è attivo. I proprietari a vita possono eseguire l'aggiornamento a Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無制限のアクセスは有効です。生涯所有者はFamily Sharingにアップグレードできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "무제한 액세스가 활성화되었습니다. 평생 소유자는 Family Sharing 로 업그레이드할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uw onbeperkte toegang is actief. Levenslange eigenaren kunnen upgraden naar Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Twój nieograniczony dostęp jest aktywny. Właściciele dożywotni mogą przejść na Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu acesso ilimitado está ativo. Proprietários vitalícios podem atualizar para o Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ваш Безлимитный доступ активен. Пожизненные владельцы могут перейти на Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "உங்கள் வரம்பற்ற அணுகல் செயலில் உள்ளது. வாழ்நாள் உரிமையாளர்கள் Family Sharing மேம்படுத்தலாம்."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "การเข้าถึงแบบไม่จำกัดของคุณเปิดใช้งานอยู่ เจ้าของตลอดอายุการใช้งานสามารถอัปเกรดเป็น Family Sharing ได้"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sınırsız erişiminiz aktif. Ömür boyu sahipler Family Sharing yükseltme yapabilir."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ваш необмежений доступ активний. Довічні власники можуть перейти на Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "آپ کی لامحدود رسائی فعال ہے۔ تاحیات مالکان Family Sharing میں اپ گریڈ کر سکتے ہیں۔"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quyền truy cập không giới hạn của bạn đang hoạt động. Người sở hữu trọn đời có thể nâng cấp lên Family Sharing ."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您的无限制访问权限已激活。终身所有者可以升级到Family Sharing 。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您的無限制存取權限已啟動。終身所有者可以升級到Family Sharing 。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
