    "Open Vox.md, then Settings > Routes to manage the Capture Bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "افتح Vox.md ثم الإعدادات > المسارات لإدارة شريط الالتقاط."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture Bar পরিচালনা করতে Vox.md খুলে সেটিংস > রুট-এ যান।"
          }
        },
        "de": {
